，先取许昌以通中原门户。 决策理由：蜀提议联吴攻魏，拒之则蜀必亲魏，吴将腹背受敌。今魏正固宛城、疏于东防，许昌守军仅8，我以柴桑13兵出12攻其不意，复得联攻之利，可胜。克许昌则吴与中原通道洞开，威逼洛阳。；密谋揭晓：准备守约"},{"id":47116,"turn":2,"type":"joint_attack_proposed","factionId":"wei","message":"魏 向 吴 提议共同进攻 蜀"},{"id":47117,"turn":2,"type":"diplomacy_response","factionId":"shu","message":"蜀拒绝了 魏 的结盟提议"},{"id":47118,"turn":2,"type":"diplomacy_response","factionId":"wu","message":"吴接受了 蜀 的联合进攻提议"},{"id":47119,"turn":2,"type":"recruit","factionId":"shu","message":"蜀 在江州征募 5 兵力"},{"id":47120,"turn":2,"type":"recruit","factionId":"wei","message":"魏 在许昌征募 5 兵力"},{"id":47121,"turn":2,"type":"attack_repulsed","factionId":"wu","message":"吴 进攻许昌失败，进攻方损失 8，守方损失 5，城防降低 1 级","payload":{"sourceCityId":"chaisang","targetCityId":"xuchang","troops":12}},{"id":47122,"turn":2,"type":"character_fallen","factionId":"wu","message":"周瑜在惨烈战斗中阵亡"},{"id":47123,"turn":2,"type":"joint_attack_broken","factionId":"shu","message":"蜀未兑现共同进攻承诺"}],"createdAt":"2026-08-20T04:12:55.874Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-20T04:14:11.111Z","exportedAt":"2026-08-20T04:14:11.112Z"}